window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Austin's out on bail. Cecilia's missing. And it's all my fault.</b></p> <p>I should have protected her—kept her safe. Instead, I pushed her away. If anything happens to her, I'll never forgive myself.</p> <p>But if playing soccer's taught me anything, it's that I'm not afraid to fight for what's mine. On the field or off, I'll play dirty if I have to.</p> <p>Because losing her isn't an option. Not this time.</p> <p>Cecilia and me? We're endgame.</p> <p><i>Gabriel and Cecilia's trilogy is now complete.</i></p>"; 
